DESCRIPTION:Danzantes del Alma proudly presents our 47th Annual Showcase: 
 “Historias de mis Raíces.”\nJoin us on April 25\, 2026\, as we take t
 he stage to celebrate our traditions\, stories\, and culture. We invite ou
