DESCRIPTION:Join the Guardian Scholars Program for an evening of storytell
 ing\, music\, and art centered on the theme "The Art of Transition" in hon
 or of Foster Care Awareness Month. This open mic offers a supportive space
  to share your unique journey through foster care\, college\, and the many
  turning points that have shaped who you are today. Whether you are debuti
 ng a piece from our workshop or simply coming to listen\, join us for a po
 werful night of community and creative expression.
URL:https://aggielife.ucdavis.edu/rsvp?id=908696
X-SOURCE:UC Davis CampusGroups
END:VEVENT
